Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.60,0:00:03.93,Top,,0,0,0,,What if your GitHub could build your portfolio website for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.38,0:00:05.32,Top,,0,0,0,,This is GitLoom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.32,0:00:07.60,Top,,0,0,0,,Every letter you type weaves a new row.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.50,0:00:09.81,Cap,,0,0,0,,Give it a username,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.81,0:00:11.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,and it reads the public repos,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.89,0:00:13.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,languages and activity,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.49,0:00:15.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,right in your browser.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.02,0:00:15.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,No sign-up,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.78,0:00:16.47,Cap,,0,0,0,,no server.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.92,0:00:19.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,Here it is with the built-in demo profile.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.16,0:00:21.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then make it yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.42,0:00:22.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,Ten templates.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.35,0:00:23.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,Same data,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.02,0:00:24.87,Cap,,0,0,0,,a completely different look.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.77,0:00:27.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Any accent colour,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.00,0:00:28.37,Cap,,0,0,0,,nine headline fonts,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.07,0:00:32.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,and drag the sections into exactly the order you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.18,0:00:35.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,Every template already has a phone layout.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.40,0:00:38.43,Cap,,0,0,0,,And the site comes finished:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.43,0:00:39.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,a Ctrl+K quick menu,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.88,0:00:40.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,project search,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.97,0:00:44.01,Cap,,0,0,0,,and a clean PDF résumé from the same data.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.91,0:00:46.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,When it looks right,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.34,0:00:47.99,Cap,,0,0,0,,download one HTML file,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.99,0:00:50.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,and host it free on GitHub Pages.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.34,0:00:51.91,Cap,,0,0,0,,GitLoom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.91,0:00:54.59,Cap,,0,0,0,,Vanilla JavaScript and the GitHub API,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.59,0:00:55.51,Cap,,0,0,0,,nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.95,0:00:57.75,Cap,,0,0,0,,Try it with your own username.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.75,0:00:59.19,Cap,,0,0,0,,The link is in the post.
